              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-navy-800 mb-2">Step 1: Define Your Ideal Customer</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-600/70 leading-relaxed mb-3">Who's your best customer? Not "everyone" — the specific type of person who buys from you repeatedly, refers others, and doesn't price-shop.</p>
              <p class="text-navy-600/70 leading-relaxed mb-2">Write down:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-navy-600/70 space-y-1">
                <li>Age range</li>
                <li>Income range</li>
                <li>Homeowner or renter</li>
                <li>Presence of children (and ages)</li>
                <li>Geography (radius, county, ZIP codes)</li>
                <li>Any lifestyle interests that matter</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
