            <div>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-navy-800 mb-2">Step 3: We Pull a Count and Send Pricing</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-600/70 leading-relaxed mb-2">We'll run a preliminary count from Experian, Acxiom, or Epsilon and send you:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-navy-600/70 space-y-1 mb-2">
